msgid "AdminSettings|To help improve GitLab and its user experience, GitLab periodically collects usage information. %{link_start}What information is shared with GitLab Inc.?%{link_end}%{br}%{br}Benefits of enabling Service Ping:%{br}• Get access to DevOps Score for your instance%{br}• Get insights and advice to maximize the value of your GitLab investment%{br}• Analyze your instance usage over time%{br}%{benefits_link_start}Learn more about the benefits of Service Ping%{link_end}"
msgstr "為了幫助改進極狐GitLab 及提升用戶體驗，極狐GitLab 將定期收集使用信息。%{link_start}與極狐(GitLab) 共享哪些信息？%{link_end}%{br}%{br}啟用 Service Ping 的好處：%{br}• 取得你執行個體的 DevOps Score 存取權限%{br}• 取得洞察與建議，將你的 GitLab 投資價值最大化%{br}• 分析你的執行個體使用情況隨時間的變化%{br}%{benefits_link_start}進一步了解 Service Ping 的好處%{link_end}"

